      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am not telling you what to do, but if you are a VRChat Creator (uploader), you can avoid this issue by routinely deleting an uploaded private avatar in a private world immediately after that avatar has been loaded for your consenting adult friends. If you forget to change avatars and VRChat can't find your current avatar, VRChat will force you to become a default VRChat Robot avatar when you join the next instance. This also avoids the issue of accidentally changing into provocative avatars in public (or otherwise) with a single-(mis)click via the avatars winglet UI entirely if you use private avatars exclusively and don't have any provocative private avatars on your account at all times.",
